    "description": "Hide and Go Seek, a boyhood favorite, has been transformed into a more fascinating and amazing mobile game\r\n\r\nA mystery welcome to <b> Hide and Go Seek: Monster Hunt </b>\r\n\r\nYou will play as a group of friends who are in small size and stay in a big area with a lot of things, with the ability to transform into items and the mission of hiding and escaping the orange giant's pursuit.\r\n\r\nSound easy, huh? You will see\r\n\r\nHOW TO PLAY\r\n- Turn to item, drag to move and find out the place to hide\r\n- Hide carefully so that they won't feel strange and catch you\r\n- Also turn into boss and find all suspicious friends in the room\r\n\r\nGAME FEATURE\r\n- Never End Level\r\n- Stunning graphic and smooth movement\r\n- Various cool skins\r\n\r\nChallenge your hiding skill in <b> Hide and Go Seek: Monster Hunt </b>\r\n\r\nDOWNLOAD NOW",
